## Technical Directive: Frontend Implementation & Data Integration Specifications

**Target Audience:** Frontend Engineering Team

**Project:** Room Revenue Tracker

**Document Ref:** `Boarding House 2026_27.xlsx` & System Logic Rules

---

### Executive Overview

This directive outlines the exact data schema, state machine conditions, metric aggregations, and UI requirements for the Room Revenue Tracker dashboard. You must replace all mock/placeholder data with the production dataset defined below and implement the required status logic and reports.

---

### 1. Data Schema & Inventory Blueprint

The system tracks **54 total bed spaces** across 4 residential blocks (`BBH`, `NWG`, `ANX`, `CRV`). Every bed space entry must include gender segregation tags and financial parameters.

