### 2. State Machine Rules (5-Day Grace Period)

The status badge for each bed space must be dynamically assigned using the following sequential evaluation logic:

```
IF tenant_name == "Vacant":
    STATUS = "Vacant"

ELSE IF total_balance == 0:
    STATUS = "✅ Paid / Secured"

ELSE IF total_balance > 0 AND (days_past_due <= 5 OR tenant_name IN APPROVED_EXTENSIONS):
    STATUS = "⏳ Grace Period"

ELSE IF total_balance > 0 AND (days_past_due > 5 OR target_month IN ["Mar", "Jun"]):
    STATUS = "❌ OVERDUE / UNPAID"

ELSE IF total_balance == current_rent AND target_month == CURRENT_MONTH:
    STATUS = "🟢 Open Window"

```

Note: The **5-Day Grace Period** ensures accounts with minor delays or active extensions are not flagged as Overdue prematurely.

